# dCMS.Fulfillment.Api — manual smoke / REST Client (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
# Local: launchSettings "http" profile → http://localhost:5287
# Docker: host port 5006 (infra/docker-compose.yml)
# Gateway (eStore / backoffice): http://localhost:5100/gateway/v1/fulfillment/...  (path → /api/v1/... upstream)
# When Auth:Enabled, set @token to a JWT with catalog:read / catalog:write and tenant_id claim = @tenantId.

@FulfillmentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5287
@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100
@tenantId = t1
@groupingId = ffg_REPLACE_ME
@slotId = ffs_REPLACE_ME
@locationId = ffc_REPLACE_ME
@partnerId = ffl_REPLACE_ME
@token =

### Health (anonymous)

GET {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List groupings (tenant)

GET {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/groupings?pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create grouping (tenant) — Auth off in Development uses no Bearer

POST {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/groupings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "groupName": "Standard Delivery",
  "code": "STD_DELIVERY",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "priority": 10,
  "active": true,
  "tenantEnabled": false,
  "maxPerTenant": null,
  "deliveryMode": "Local Delivery",
  "limitSelectedDistributionCenter": false,
  "stockLocation": ""
}

###

### List slots for grouping

GET {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/groupings/{{groupingId}}/slots
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get / put tenant JSON settings (predefinedFields, dynamicFields, stockLocations)

GET {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/settings
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

PUT {{FulfillmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "predefinedFields": [],
  "dynamicFields": [],
  "stockLocations": []
}

###

### Via Gateway — same path after /gateway/v1/fulfillment

GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/v1/fulfillment/tenants/{{tenantId}}/fulfillment/groupings?pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
